# INTEGRITY.json hashes the exact bytes of every runtime file and strict
# mode refuses to start on any mismatch, so Git must never rewrite line
# endings on checkout (Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true).
# Every file is stored and checked out byte for byte, LF included; the
# .cmd/.bat launchers are label-free and run correctly with LF.
*            -text
*.png        binary
*.mcpb       binary
*.whl        binary
*.zip        binary
*.gitbundle  binary
